 J\L\S\K\N \L\B\K\NSteer angle no init \Y\S\K\NA\L\B\K\N -G85 not active\L\S\K\N

If the steering angle sender -G85 is currently not active:
 - Unplug the diagnostic connection.
 - Start the engine.
